t on for me Then my girls took me on a beach trip I posted one picture In my bikini, no caption I woke up to it on a hotel bed 2-14, he can't sleep Scrolling back to what he couldn't keep 2-14, he like my picture 2-16, you look different I left it on red While the girls screamed on a hotel bed 9am, another message His new girl, she saw the light Not to be weird, what are you taking? No BBL, two drops Every morning It's called a move of idle drops So I send her the link Buy two, get one free Up to 67% off In a 90-day money back guarantee And I'm sending it to you too, link below Mama one sells out all the time So grab yours while it's there, yeah He's up at 2-14, mmm I'm asleep by 10\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopamua.com/products/amua-vitaldrops\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopamua.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Embrace your curves, naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":53137,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":478,\"duplicates\":2,\"reachDelta1d\":398,\"reachDelta7d\":6316,\"reachDelta30d\":47696},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CA\",\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":21,\"currentRank\":21,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":3.95},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":1,\"limit\":8,\"total\":4314,\"totalPages\":540,\"offset\":0,\"isTotalApproximate\":false},\"meta\":{\"query\":\"shopamua.com\",\"keywords\":[],\"searchIn\":\"domain\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"reach\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":8,\"effectiveLimit\":8,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"all\",\"page\":1,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrow