ry. No injections. No recovery. How long before you saw results? Few weeks. But by month two, I couldn't fit my old jeans. Look, I'm not trying to take your man. I don't want him back. But if you're worried about how you look, that's on you to fix. Not me. What's it called? Why should I tell you? You locked me in a bathroom. I'm sorry. Okay? I just... He still has your photos. That messes with your head. Amua. A-M-U-A. Vital Drops. Is there a website? There's a link. I'll write it down. Thank you. Mm-hmm. And delete my photos off his phone. That's weird. Yeah. There you are. Where'd you go? Bathroom. You good? I'm good. You sure? I'm about to be better. What does that mean? Nothing. Let's go. My ex's new girlfriend locked me in a bathroom, got in my face, said he still has my old photos on his phone, said he couldn't stop staring at me. She thought I had surgery. I didn't. A-M-U-A Vital Drops.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://shopamua.com/pages/curve-quiz\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"shopamua.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Embrace your curves, naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":28267,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":254,\"duplicates\":5,\"reachDelta1d\":1507,\"reachDelta7d\":21043,\"reachDelta30d\":24499},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":33,\"currentRank\":33,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":6.2},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1096567963205951\",\"collationId\":\"1449879317294359\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-07T11:55:13.519Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-06T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-15T23:02:22.247Z\",\"daysRunning\":10,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/09cfb06083a032f603c7