{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LWrLZKc5QbRKagBGs1xd9p","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"e03e0ea1-38bc-47e9-8e02-6580e18ae17f\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1499760164838322\",\"collationId\":\"1637744667560659\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-09T00:08:00.540Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-04-08T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-10-26T23:26:12.511Z\",\"daysRunning\":222,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/bbacbc11bd3ddc3d354a1d98025220fef2dd70b73391fca9e6a01f34fe765d90.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/b78415043bdfa462448194bb988661436efed3cd23871b4ecf003ee9c15f4983.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"184210271447004\",\"name\":\"Flourish After 40\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/184210271447004.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"184210271447004\",\"liveAdsCount\":69,\"reach30d\":885643,\"totalReach\":6133751,\"countriesCount\":5,\"facebookLikes\":2278,\"instagramFollowers\":10361},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"My hip started hurting when I tried to sleep on it.\\n\\nThen my knees started aching.\\n\\nThen my shoulders felt stiff every single morning.\\n\\nI thought it was just aging.\\n\\nThat’s what I was told.\\n\\nSo I tried everything.\\n\\nIbuprofen.\\n\\nTurmeric.\\n\\nCollagen.\\n\\nNothing actually fixed it.\\n\\nThe pain just kept spreading.\\n\\nAnd getting worse.\\n\\nThen I learned something that completely changed everything.\\n\\nIt wasn’t just “wear and tear.”\\n\\nIt was low estrogen.\\n\\nEstrogen is what keeps your joints cushioned and your tendons flexible.\\n\\nWhen it drops after menopause, everything starts to dry out.\\n\\nThat’s why the pain shows up everywhere.\\n\\nThat’s why nothing seems to work.\\n\\nBecause you’re not fixing the real cause.\\n\\nThat’s when I came across something I had never heard about before.\\n\\nMoringa.\\n\\nIt contains phytoestrogens — natural plant compounds that act like estrogen in your body.\\n\\nNot synthetic hormones.\\n\\nJust natural support.\\n\\nThat’s when I found Her Again.\\n\\nIt’s built around a potent form of moringa designed for women going through menopause.\\n\\nWithin a few weeks, I noticed a real difference.\\n\\nThe stiffness started easing.\\n\\nThe aches weren’t constant anymore.\\n\\nI could finally sleep without waking up in pain.\\n\\nIf your joints have been hurting since menopause and nothing has worked, it might not be your joints.\\n\\nIt might be low estrogen.\",\"transcript\":\"If your hip hurts when you try to sleep on it, that's low estrogen. Do your knees ache since menopause? That's low estrogen. Do your shoulders feel stiff every single morning no matter what you do? That's low estrogen. What about your lower back, your fingers, your ankles? All of it, low estrogen. I'm an OB-GYN and I've had hundreds of women sit across from me in the last 10 years with the exact same story. Joint pain since menopause, no answers, nothing working, and this is what nobody tells them. When your estrogen drops, everything just starts to fall apart. Your tendons get stiff and dry. Your joints lose their cushioning. You can't sleep because there's no position that doesn't hurt. Getting out of bed in the morning is its own whole thing. The stairs. It all hurts. And every year you leave it, it gets worse. I got sick of sitting across from women in my office who were in agony, telling me they couldn't live like this anymore. And the only thing I could offer them was synthetic hormones with a list of side effects as long as my arm. I found a plant that women have been using for centuries. It has natural phytoestrogens in it. Phytoestrogens are plant compounds that mimic estrogen in your body, so they actually bring your levels back up. And Moringa has about five times more of them than soy or flaxseed, naturally. No prescription, none of the risks. I started looking for something with a proper dose of it, specifically Moringa oleifera, which is the variety with the highest phytoestrogen levels. And that's exactly what Huragan is built around. Once your estrogen starts balancing, things start to change quickly. Your joints get their cushioning back. The stiffness starts to ease off. You start sleeping pain-free. The women I recommended this to, I'd get calls three weeks later. They could sleep on their hip again. They were walking the dog again, getting through the day without reaching for the ibuprofen. If low estrogen is left untreated, the wear and tear becomes irreversible, leading to early arthritis and long-term mobility issues. Huragan's potent Moringa prevents all of this by balancing the estrogen levels within weeks. With added curcumin to get rid of the inflammation, you'll feel the lubrication effects within days. It's the missing piece your joints and tendons have been missing since menopause. I've linked the product I'm using down below. They're running a buy one, get one free sale, but it won't last long.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://www.hernovabottle.com/products/menopaused\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"hernovabottle.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Fix Menopause Joint Pain Naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":429757,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":3868,\"duplicates\":37,\"reachDelta1d\":127,\"reachDelta7d\":2358,\"reachDelta30d\":31316},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"NZ\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":20,\"currentRank\":20,\"rankDelta\":0,\"improvementPct\":38.46},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_28902154656123803\",\"collationId\":\"1399905601573732\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-20T19:18:34.163Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-20T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-30T09:30:10.697Z\",\"daysRunning\":57,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/4c8a2dad313d318a2438ed6fa5259a16da529610dc077219e8e4aa98a7d3bfa8.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"234245929761763\",\"name\":\"Wellness over 40\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/234245929761763.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"234245929761763\",\"liveAdsCount\":269,\"reach30d\":72639,\"totalReach\":302340,\"countriesCount\":169,\"facebookLikes\":1580,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"ORA is powered by four standardized botanical extracts — maritime pine bark rich in OPCs, ruscus root for venous tone, tiger grass for its triterpenes, and citrus hesperidin. Most drainage formulas only push fluid out. Hesperidin is the one that works on capillary permeability, so the fluid stops leaking back into the tissue — which is why the result holds instead of fading after two weeks. Clean, no-BS ingredients with nothing hormonal: no red clover, no phytoestrogens, no stimulant, no diuretic. Just one gummy a day with food, for lighter legs and less morning puffiness. No powders, no drops, no routine to remember.\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://en.getfeelora.com/products/ora-gummies\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"en.getfeelora.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Powered by Two of Nature's Most Studied Botanicals 🌿\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"Do you wake up with a puffy face, a foggy mind (brain fog) and a heavy body? 😩 👉 It's often the sign of a sluggish lymphatic system, where water and toxins stagnate in the body ✨ Helps de-puff the face, belly and legs 🧠 Promotes a clearer mind (less brain fog) 💧 Reduces water retention...\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":6892,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":62,\"duplicates\":18,\"reachDelta1d\":38,\"reachDelta7d\":247,\"reachDelta30d\":3584},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AF\",\"AG\",\"AI\",\"AM\",\"AR\",\"AS\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"AZ\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BF\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BJ\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BT\",\"BW\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CD\",\"CF\",\"CG\",\"CK\",\"CL\",\"CN\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CV\",\"CW\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"DM\",\"DO\",\"DZ\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"ES\",\"ET\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GA\",\"GB\",\"GD\",\"GE\",\"GF\",\"GH\",\"GI\",\"GM\",\"GN\",\"GP\",\"GR\",\"GT\",\"GU\",\"GW\",\"GY\",\"HK\",\"HN\",\"HR\",\"HT\",\"HU\",\"ID\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IM\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"JM\",\"JO\",\"JP\",\"KH\",\"KI\",\"KN\",\"KR\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"KZ\",\"LA\",\"LB\",\"LC\",\"LR\",\"LS\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"LY\",\"MF\",\"ML\",\"MM\",\"MN\",\"MO\",\"MP\",\"MQ\",\"MR\",\"MT\",\"MU\",\"MV\",\"MX\",\"NA\",\"NC\",\"NE\",\"NF\",\"NI\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"OM\",\"PA\",\"PE\",\"PF\",\"PG\",\"PH\",\"PL\",\"PR\",\"PS\",\"PT\",\"PY\",\"QA\",\"RE\",\"RO\",\"RW\",\"SA\",\"SB\",\"SC\",\"SE\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"SL\",\"SN\",\"SO\",\"SR\",\"SS\",\"SV\",\"SX\",\"SY\",\"SZ\",\"TD\",\"TG\",\"TH\",\"TJ\",\"TL\",\"TN\",\"TO\",\"TR\",\"TT\",\"TZ\",\"UG\",\"US\",\"UY\",\"UZ\",\"VC\",\"VE\",\"VG\",\"VI\",\"VN\",\"VU\",\"YE\",\"YT\",\"ZA\",\"ZM\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":31,\"currentRank\":31,\"rankDelta\":93,\"improvementPct\":12.7},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1646431660250473\",\"collationId\":\"1986148922055995\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-01T10:41:41.321Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-30T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-10-02T11:33:33.773Z\",\"daysRunning\":47,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/0c0449e58958322a3010b90917944c8a7874b7ff6382cf3358f27326f5121590.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/77a894191940cd7800c3b4f45b10686a0967ba2f7110b707e1bb7e40c7913976.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"2901493546558691\",\"name\":\"Natural raw\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/2901493546558691.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"2901493546558691\",\"liveAdsCount\":189,\"reach30d\":191115,\"totalReach\":346410,\"countriesCount\":170,\"facebookLikes\":1405,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"ORA is powered by four standardized botanical extracts — maritime pine bark rich in OPCs, ruscus root for venous tone, tiger grass for its triterpenes, and citrus hesperidin. Most drainage formulas only push fluid out. Hesperidin is the one that works on capillary permeability, so the fluid stops leaking back into the tissue — which is why the result holds instead of fading after two weeks. Clean, no-BS ingredients with nothing hormonal: no red clover, no phytoestrogens, no stimulant, no diuretic. Just one gummy a day with food, for lighter legs and less morning puffiness. No powders, no drops, no routine to remember.\",\"transcript\":\"Your belly looks like this, your ankles look like this, and your hands look like this. You're not fat. Your lymphatic system is clogged, and the best thing to unclog your lymphatic system is not cutting carbs, not cutting salt, and it is definitely not compression socks from brands that profit when you stay puffy. Let me show you what actually works. One small gummy every evening works better than all of those combined. Yet almost nobody's talking about it. This is not only about how your jeans fit. When your ankles are swollen by the end of the day, when your belly won't go down no matter what you do, when you're exhausted by 2 p.m. and crashed on the couch by seven, your lymphatic system has been clogging for years. That buildup traps fluid, drains your strength, and leaves you feeling like you aged 20 years overnight. You wake up stiff. Your legs feel heavy. You have no energy without reason. This is not age. This is fluid and toxins choking your lymphatic system shut. Left alone, this is what wears men down too early. This is what makes your body give out when you least expect it. In over 20 years of working with my clients, I have found one thing that fixes it faster than anything else. It is called Aura. When four plant compounds work together—Butcher's Broom, Pine Bark, Citrus Hesperidin, and Centella Asiatica—they rebuild the vessel strength your lymphatic system lost. This combination tightens your vessel walls and clears the fluid blocking your body's drainage. Once that happens, your fluid starts moving again. Your energy comes back. That heavy feeling in your legs disappears. I have recommended this to clients who are exhausted, stuck, and ready to give up. They all come back to me weeks later saying the swelling went down, their energy came back, and when they check the mirror, they feel like themselves instead of exhausted for the first time in years. The only thing they changed was one gummy every evening. But do not buy the cheap drainage gummies on Amazon. Most of them are diuretics in disguise. That's water loss for a day, not real drainage. The only thing they do is make you pee more. And do not bother with dry brushing alone. It pushes surface fluid for an hour, leaves your system in an hour, does nothing. The only one I trust is from a small brand called Feelera. Pure Aura dosed at clinical levels, plus nothing riding along for the label. Deep red gummies. That is the real color of concentrated Pine Bark. They are third-party tested and completely dosed like real clinical Aura is. I'll leave the link below. If it's still there, it means they still have stock. Be quick. After you click Add to Cart, you'll see there's a limited sale happening. The fermentation of these compounds takes time. It can't be rushed. When this batch sells out, it takes time to make more. Take care of your lymphatic system, not just for you, but also for your family.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://en.getfeelora.com/products/ora-gummies\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"en.getfeelora.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Powered by Two of Nature's Most Studied Botanicals 🌿\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":56774,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":511,\"duplicates\":16,\"reachDelta1d\":1272,\"reachDelta7d\":5331,\"reachDelta30d\":26561},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AF\",\"AG\",\"AM\",\"AR\",\"AS\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"AZ\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BF\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BI\",\"BJ\",\"BL\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BT\",\"BW\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CK\",\"CL\",\"CN\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CV\",\"CW\",\"CX\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DJ\",\"DK\",\"DO\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"ER\",\"ES\",\"ET\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FK\",\"FM\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GD\",\"GE\",\"GF\",\"GH\",\"GI\",\"GM\",\"GN\",\"GP\",\"GQ\",\"GR\",\"GT\",\"GU\",\"GW\",\"GY\",\"HK\",\"HN\",\"HR\",\"HT\",\"HU\",\"ID\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IM\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"JM\",\"JO\",\"JP\",\"KG\",\"KH\",\"KM\",\"KR\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"KZ\",\"LA\",\"LB\",\"LC\",\"LR\",\"LS\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"LY\",\"MF\",\"MM\",\"MN\",\"MO\",\"MP\",\"MQ\",\"MR\",\"MT\",\"MU\",\"MV\",\"MX\",\"NA\",\"NC\",\"NI\",\"NL\",\"NU\",\"NZ\",\"OM\",\"PA\",\"PE\",\"PF\",\"PG\",\"PL\",\"PR\",\"PS\",\"PT\",\"PW\",\"PY\",\"QA\",\"RE\",\"RO\",\"RW\",\"SA\",\"SC\",\"SE\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"SL\",\"SN\",\"SO\",\"SR\",\"SS\",\"SV\",\"SX\",\"SY\",\"SZ\",\"TC\",\"TD\",\"TG\",\"TH\",\"TL\",\"TM\",\"TN\",\"TO\",\"TR\",\"TT\",\"TV\",\"TZ\",\"UG\",\"US\",\"UY\",\"UZ\",\"VC\",\"VE\",\"VG\",\"VI\",\"VN\",\"WF\",\"WS\",\"YE\",\"YT\",\"ZA\",\"ZM\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":6,\"currentRank\":6,\"rankDelta\":2,\"improvementPct\":4.65},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1792010605168951\",\"collationId\":\"1401118958308766\",\"platform