ainage, morning puffiness, and stubborn bloat that never goes down. We've sold out multiple times, and women keep coming back for it because it works. So if you've been thinking about trying Aura, don't wait. Today you can get up to four sachets for the price of two, and you'll be completely covered by their 60-day money-back guarantee. But if you're still seeing the link below, that means it's still in stock. Tap in before it disappears again.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://en.getfeelora.com/products/ora-gummies\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"en.getfeelora.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Powered by Two of Nature's Most Studied Botanicals 🌿\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":6680,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":60,\"duplicates\":15,\"reachDelta1d\":87,\"reachDelta7d\":518,\"reachDelta30d\":2474},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AF\",\"AI\",\"AM\",\"AR\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AZ\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BF\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BJ\",\"BM\",\"BN\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BW\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CN\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CW\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"DO\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"ER\",\"ES\",\"ET\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FK\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GB\",\"GF\",\"GH\",\"GP\",\"GR\",\"GT\",\"GU\",\"GW\",\"GY\",\"HK\",\"HN\",\"HR\",\"HT\",\"HU\",\"ID\",\"IE\",\"IL\",\"IM\",\"IT\",\"JE\",\"JM\",\"JO\",\"JP\",\"KW\",\"KY\",\"KZ\",\"LA\",\"LB\",\"LR\",\"LS\",\"LT\",\"LU\",\"LV\",\"LY\",\"MF\",\"ML\",\"MN\",\"MP\",\"MQ\",\"MT\",\"MU\",\"MX\",\"NA\",\"NC\",\"NI\",\"NL\",\"NZ\",\"OM\",\"PA\",\"PE\",\"PF\",\"PG\",\"PL\",\"PR\",\"PS\",\"PT\",\"PY\",\"QA\",\"RE\",\"RO\",\"RW\",\"SA\",\"SC\",\"SE\",\"SI\",\"SK\",\"SL\",\"SN\",\"SO\",\"SS\",\"SV\",\"SX\",\"SY\",\"SZ\",\"TH\",\"TN\",\"TR\",\"TT\",\"TZ\",\"UG\",\"US\",\"UZ\",\"VC\",\"VE\",\"VI\",\"VN\",\"YE\",\"YT\",\"ZA\"],\"mainCountry\":\"IT\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":16,\"currentRank\":16,\"rankDelta\":63,\"improvementPct\":12.4},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1393884042891962\",\"collationId\":\"2147774365952697\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-18T14:27:41.572Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-09-17T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-09-20T19:18:49.279Z\",\"daysRunning\":60,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/6b651b3d1424da12e5b267b4cf3faa1ec6477ce6917fcd74902383817f7e6aea.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/088ecc84d375859cc1601454b5bdf529ef19c79d6032e1bb48438fd89a44c43d.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"234245929761763\",\"name\":\"Wellness over 40\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/profile_picture/234245929761763.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"234245929761763\",\"liveAdsCount\":269,\"reach30d\":72639,\"totalReach\":302340,\"countriesCount\":182,\"facebookLikes\":1580,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"ORA is powered by four standardized botanical extracts — maritime pine bark rich in OPCs, ruscus root for venous tone, tiger grass for its triterpenes, and citrus hesperidin. Most drainage formulas only push fluid out. Hesperidin is the one that works on capillary permeability, so the fluid stops leaking back into the tissue — which is why the result holds instead of fading after two weeks. Clean, no-BS ingredients with nothing hormonal: no red clover, no phytoestrogens, no stimulant, no diuretic. Just one gummy a day with food, for lighter legs and less morning puffiness. No powders, no drops, no routine to remember.\",\"transcript\":\"You're compressing your cellulite on the surface, but what's happening inside your body? Day one, you pull them on. Your legs look smoother right away. You think it's working. Night one, you peel them off. Red lines printed all over your skin. An hour later, your ankles are swollen again. Day 30, nothing has changed underneath. You just can't see it during the day. Day 90, it's 90 degrees out. You wear them anyway, and you sweat through the afternoon. Or you skip them and hide your legs instead. Day 365, you feel trapped. Nothing changed. You still can't wear a skirt without them. Here's what nobody tells you: compression squeezes from the outside. It moves water for a few hours. It never goes beneath the surface. Water leaks out of your vessels all day long. That part is normal. What isn't normal is it staying there. When it stays, it stretches the tissue under your skin. That stretching is the dimpling you see. Aura works where the water is. Pine bark and hesperidin work on the vessel walls themselves. They tighten them so less water escapes into your tissue in the first place. Butcher's broom tightens your veins so they grip instead of sagging. That's what pushes the water back into your bloodstream, and your kidneys flush it out. Centella rebuilds the tissue, the water stretched. That's the layer that decides whether your skin looks smooth or dimpled. All this combined in one gummy. Aura, buy one get one free. 60 day money back guarantee. Link below.\",\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://en.getfeelora.com/products/ora-gummies\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"en.getfeelora.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Powered by Two of Nature's Most Studied Botanicals 🌿\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":414,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":4,\"duplicates\":15,\"reachDelta1d\":2,\"reachDelta7d\":4,\"reachDelta30d\":7},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\",\"AF\",\"AG\",\"AI\",\"AM\",\"AO\",\"AR\",\"AS\",\"AT\",\"AU\",\"AW\",\"BB\",\"BE\",\"BF\",\"BG\",\"BH\",\"BI\",\"BJ\",\"BM\",\"BO\",\"BR\",\"BS\",\"BT\",\"BW\",\"BZ\",\"CA\",\"CC\",\"CD\",\"CF\",\"CG\",\"CI\",\"CK\",\"CL\",\"CM\",\"CO\",\"CR\",\"CV\",\"CW\",\"CY\",\"CZ\",\"DE\",\"DJ\",\"DK\",\"DM\",\"DO\",\"DZ\",\"EC\",\"EE\",\"EG\",\"ES\",\"ET\",\"FI\",\"FJ\",\"FK\",\"FO\",\"FR\",\"GA\",\"GB\",\"GD\